00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:33.780
It's chess.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:34.980
R is for rook.

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:36.050
Q is for queen.

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:37.150
P is for pawn.

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:38.350
N is for knight.

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:43.560
They're initials for the chess pieces, and the
eight-by-eight buildings represent the chessboard.

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:46.530
