00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:04.950
If I remember right,
the murder happened in this room.

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:06.780
Next was a B, a bishop.

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:08.480
Her room was here.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:11.180
The thirtieth victim was a Q,
and her room was here.

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:15.680
The thirty-first victim was an N,
and it happened here...

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:18.860
Then the rook moves here...

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:23.050
The thirty-third and latest victim
was a king, and moves here.

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.400
Well? Now are you convinced?

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:28.240
It's true, the pieces do move properly.

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:28.470
